---
import { SITE_CONFIG } from '../data/config';
---

<section class="py-24 md:py-32 bg-concrete relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-px bg-safety/20"></div>

  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 relative">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start">
      <!-- Texto -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
          <div class="h-px w-12 bg-safety"></div>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-safety">Quem Somos</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="font-display text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl text-pale uppercase leading-[0.95] mb-8">
          Especialistas em
          <span class="text-safety">aluguel de caçamba</span>
          no Rio
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-5 text-pale/60 text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
          <p>
            A {SITE_CONFIG.name} nasceu com uma missão clara: acabar com a dor de cabeça de quem precisa
            de aluguel de caçamba de entulho. Com frota própria, equipe treinada e licença ambiental,
            já atendemos centenas de obras na região.
          </p>
          <p>
            Nosso compromisso é entregar no prazo, cobrar o preço justo e garantir que todo resíduo
            seja descartado de forma correta e legal.
          </p>
        </div>

        <a
          href="/sobre/"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mt-10 text-safety font-display uppercase tracking-wider text-lg hover:text-pale transition-colors group"
        >
          Conheça Nossa História
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Stats -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-concrete-light border border-steel p-6 md:p-8">
          <p class="font-display text-5xl md:text-6xl text-safety leading-none mb-2">+500</p>
          <p class="text-pale/50 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-sans">Obras Atendidas</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-concrete-light border border-steel p-6 md:p-8">
          <p class="font-display text-5xl md:text-6xl text-safety leading-none mb-2">4.9</p>
          <p class="text-pale/50 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-sans">Nota Média</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-concrete-light border border-steel p-6 md:p-8">
          <p class="font-display text-5xl md:text-6xl text-safety leading-none mb-2">24h</p>
          <p class="text-pale/50 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-sans">Entrega Garantida</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-concrete-light border border-steel p-6 md:p-8">
          <p class="font-display text-5xl md:text-6xl text-safety leading-none mb-2">15+</p>
          <p class="text-pale/50 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-sans">Anos de Experiência</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
